<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Kaynar as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Kaynar as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers analyst Joel Tiss started coverage of Kaynar Technologies Inc with a buy rating, the firm said Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Lehman was the lead underwriter of the aerospace fastener company's May initial public offering. It went public at $14.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-1/8 to 18-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Tiss gave the stock a 12- to 18-month price target of $22, based on 15 to 16 times his 1998 earnings estimate of $1.45 a share.</p>
<p>-- He said industry fundamentals looks strong, with demand outpacing supply.</p>
</text>
